#: ../../functions/func_sortmulti.rst:6
msgid "$sortmulti"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_sortmulti.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$sortmulti(name[,separator])**"
msgstr "用法：**$sortmulti(name[,separator])**"

#: ../../functions/func_sortmulti.rst:9
msgid "Category: multi-value"
msgstr "类别：多值"

#: ../../functions/func_sortmulti.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 2.3.1"
msgstr "实现：Picard 2.3.1"

#: ../../functions/func_sortmulti.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_sortmulti.rst:14
msgid "Returns a copy of the multi-value variable ``name`` with the elements sorted in ascending order. A literal value representing a multi-value can be substituted for ``name``, using the ``separator`` (or a semicolon followed by a space \"; \" if not passed) to coerce the value into a proper multi-valued variable. If ``name`` is missing ``$sortmulti`` will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"返回多值变量 ``name`` 的副本，其元素按升序排序。可以用代表多值的字面值替换 "
"``name``，使用 ``separator``（如果未传递，则使用分号后跟空格 \"; \"）将值强制"
"转换为正确的多值变量。如果 ``name`` 缺失 ``$sortmulti`` 将返回空字符串。"

